  "statuteText": "485-A:11 Public Waters Classified. –\n\nAll lakes and ponds defined as public waters of the state by RSA 271:20 shall be classified by the passage of this section as not less than Class B, as set forth in RSA 485-A:8 relating to standards for classification of surface waters of the state."
